{
  "name": "GroupByAddress",
  "formula": "=LAMBDA(key_cell,length_cell,return_columns,LET(rRow,ROW(key_cell),fCol,CELL(\"col\",return_columns),lCol,fCol+COLUMNS(return_columns)-1,n,ROWS({ref}ExpandToLastRow(length_cell)),keyArr,{ref}ExpandToLastRow(key_cell,,n),keyArrClean,IF(keyArr=0,\"\",keyArr),changedRows,{ref}NextDiff(keyArrClean),keys,CHOOSECOLS(changedRows,1),firstRows_arr,CHOOSECOLS(changedRows,2),lastRows_arr,IF(ROWS(firstRows_arr)=1,n,VSTACK(DROP(firstRows_arr,1)-1,n)),firstRows_sheet,firstRows_arr+rRow-1,lastRows_sheet,lastRows_arr+rRow-1,fCell,ADDRESS(firstRows_sheet,fCol),lCell,ADDRESS(lastRows_sheet,lCol),sheetName,\"'\"&{ref}GetSheetName(key_cell)&\"'!\",returnAddressArr,sheetName&fCell&\":\"&lCell,HSTACK(keys,firstRows_sheet,lastRows_sheet,returnAddressArr)))",
  "comment": "Returns key, first row, last row, and address for each group. Arguments: key_cell, length_cell, return_columns. Blanks continue a group until the first blank in length_cell. A key of 0 is blank. All-blank keys return #CALC!. Last Update at 2026-11-03.",
